  and NASA Earthdata. NASA Earth science data are free and open, with no
  restrictions on use: https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/about/esdis-policy

  Required acknowledgement (adapt when finalising the submission):
  "NISAR data courtesy of NASA/JPL-Caltech and ISRO, accessed through the ASF
